(4135895, 594772, 34618, '<td valign="top">Overall this is pleasing. Color is nice. Composition decent. Sharpness is lacking though. Cropping might benefit from less centered or, perhaps, less square image, maybe more landscape orientation?? I think if the center lens had been lit more and the DOF or sharpness tweaked it would be an 8. As it stands, though, I''m voting 5.5 (6). Hope this is helpful.</td>', 'Overall this is pleasing. Color is nice. Composition decent. Sharpness is lacking though. Cropping might benefit from less centered or, perhaps, less square image, maybe more landscape orientation?? I think if the center lens had been lit more and the DOF or sharpness tweaked it would be an 8. As it stands, though, I''m voting 5.5 (6). Hope this is helpful.', '2007-10-03 01:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4135902, 592999, 34618, '<td valign="top">Wild! I love it. My only criticism is the blurred swatch of neon-like yellow-orange shape in the upper left corner. That detracts from what one would expect to be the continuation of the mask.</td>', 'Wild! I love it. My only criticism is the blurred swatch of neon-like yellow-orange shape in the upper left corner. That detracts from what one would expect to be the continuation of the mask.', '2007-10-03 01:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4135904, 593437, 34618, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2007-10-03 01:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4135908, 593126, 34618, '<td valign="top">Appropriate title, nice color and contrast between organic and synthetic but seems slightly oversharpened.</td>', 'Appropriate title, nice color and contrast between organic and synthetic but seems slightly oversharpened.', '2007-10-03 02:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4135910, 592088, 34618, '<td valign="top">Cute. Nice DOF.</td>', 'Cute. Nice DOF.', '2007-10-03 02:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4135918, 593195, 34618, '<td valign="top">Lighting could be more dramatic like with two or three color cells or spots. Even a single contrasting color washing the wall would help. Or darking the wall more to bring out the hand and board. Also, the little light colored object sticking out from the bottom left corner of the board is significantly distracting.</td>', 'Lighting could be more dramatic like with two or three color cells or spots. Even a single contrasting color washing the wall would help. Or darking the wall more to bring out the hand and board. Also, the little light colored object sticking out from the bottom left corner of the board is significantly distracting.', '2007-10-03 02:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4135920, 594267, 34618, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. Great tone and DOF.</td>', 'Very nice shot. Great tone and DOF.', '2007-10-03 02:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4135927, 594026, 34618, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, decent composition and crop, great dichotomy between the images. Very appropriate and original title. My only criticism, but it''s a biggie, is that your highlights are blown and it''s too contrasty.</td>', 'Nice idea, decent composition and crop, great dichotomy between the images. Very appropriate and original title. My only criticism, but it''s a biggie, is that your highlights are blown and it''s too contrasty.', '2007-10-03 02:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4135934, 593249, 34618, '<td valign="top">This would look really good with better lighting like a single spot or a two point setup. It looks a bit too snapshot-ish and not dramatic enough. The idea is good, I think, but it lack punch.</td>', 'This would look really good with better lighting like a single spot or a two point setup. It looks a bit too snapshot-ish and not dramatic enough. The idea is good, I think, but it lack punch.', '2007-10-03 02:10:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4135936, 594157, 34618, '<td valign="top">This is a really cool picture. You should do really well with this. Good luck.</td>', 'This is a really cool picture. You should do really well with this. Good luck.', '2007-10-03 02:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4135942, 594179, 34618, '<td valign="top">Nice tone and texture. To the point and appropriate title and subject for the Challenge. Nice job.</td>', 'Nice tone and texture. To the point and appropriate title and subject for the Challenge. Nice job.', '2007-10-03 02:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
