(4135961, 592854, 34618, '<td valign="top">I just tried it and it really looks a lot better with a much tighter crop. Especially losing the foreground, but if you cut it close enough so the stuff in the back is almost gone and the front is cropped just enough to save the shadow, it''s a pretty interesting shot. Hope this is helpful.</td>', 'I just tried it and it really looks a lot better with a much tighter crop. Especially losing the foreground, but if you cut it close enough so the stuff in the back is almost gone and the front is cropped just enough to save the shadow, it''s a pretty interesting shot. Hope this is helpful.', '2007-10-03 02:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4135963, 594466, 30454, '<td valign="top">Shooting for Brown, eh?</td>', 'Shooting for Brown, eh?', '2007-10-03 02:17:23.000000', NULL, 1),
