(4135994, 591878, 76430, '<td valign="top">Hi Stephen.  It looks like you got some camera blur in the white pieces.  I suggest using a tripod.  The background is a little distracting, but otherwise good composition showing technology as well as the old game of chess.</td>', 'Hi Stephen.  It looks like you got some camera blur in the white pieces.  I suggest using a tripod.  The background is a little distracting, but otherwise good composition showing technology as well as the old game of chess.', '2007-10-03 02:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
