(4136029, 594596, 62318, '<td valign="top">For some reason I am actually intrigued by this photo. I think it is the contrast of textures, simple palette and the overall design of the elements. I''m drawn to give you an 8. It is photography in a different sense.</td>', 'For some reason I am actually intrigued by this photo. I think it is the contrast of textures, simple palette and the overall design of the elements. I''m drawn to give you an 8. It is photography in a different sense.', '2007-10-03 02:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
