(4136195, 594536, 78062, '<td valign="top">erm... was this meant to be in the technology challenge? whereis the representation of technology in this?<br/> <br/>Also, this is far too noisy. It could do with a dose of neat image and a lot of other work to make it halfway decent- the waves are out of focus, the sky looks dead and it all looks a little underexposed where it shouldn''t be.<br/> <br/>Did you shoot this with a camera phone? That''s the only reasoning I can think of.</td>', 'erm... was this meant to be in the technology challenge? whereis the representation of technology in this? Also, this is far too noisy. It could do with a dose of neat image and a lot of other work to make it halfway decent- the waves are out of focus, the sky looks dead and it all looks a little underexposed where it shouldn''t be. Did you shoot this with a camera phone? That''s the only reasoning I can think of.', '2007-10-03 04:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
