(4136717, 593683, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice and crisp, neat perspective and colors. It just seems too dead-centered to me. My eye does not move through the picture at all, but just lands on the front corner of the building and stays there.</td>', 'Nice and crisp, neat perspective and colors. It just seems too dead-centered to me. My eye does not move through the picture at all, but just lands on the front corner of the building and stays there.', '2007-10-03 10:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
