(4140429, 594026, 33515, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea behind the photo, perfect if the cars were Mustangs. But in the end all the highlights are gone and the slow shutter speed leaves the 2nd and 3rd cars to blurred for my taste. Like I said I really like the idea here.</td>', 'I really like the idea behind the photo, perfect if the cars were Mustangs. But in the end all the highlights are gone and the slow shutter speed leaves the 2nd and 3rd cars to blurred for my taste. Like I said I really like the idea here.', '2007-10-04 09:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4140435, 593126, 33515, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but this just looks like a snap shot of a cell tower, a few more minutes circling the area I''m sure with the blue sky, palms, and the moon you could have found a better spot to take this. BTW nice detail in the moon.</td>', 'Sorry, but this just looks like a snap shot of a cell tower, a few more minutes circling the area I''m sure with the blue sky, palms, and the moon you could have found a better spot to take this. BTW nice detail in the moon.', '2007-10-04 09:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4140440, 591876, 33515, '<td valign="top">Youre image is only 253X396, try to take full advantage of the size limitations.</td>', 'Youre image is only 253X396, try to take full advantage of the size limitations.', '2007-10-04 09:17:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4140449, 594536, 33515, '<td valign="top">I''m not really sure of the tie to technology but, if she was facing the other way, into the sun, you could have picked up some detail in her face instead of the back of her head and had a more interesting picture.</td>', 'I''m not really sure of the tie to technology but, if she was facing the other way, into the sun, you could have picked up some detail in her face instead of the back of her head and had a more interesting picture.', '2007-10-04 09:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4140459, 594651, 33515, '<td valign="top">Could have added a little bit to the photo if the widow the man is looking out was not cut off. Also if the focus of the picture was on him alond with the red tubes and dumpster.</td>', 'Could have added a little bit to the photo if the widow the man is looking out was not cut off. Also if the focus of the picture was on him alond with the red tubes and dumpster.', '2007-10-04 09:22:37.000000', NULL, 1);
