(4140724, 592873, 33515, '<td valign="top">Nice macro, you could have turned your subject 180 so the writing on the chip was facing us.Good photo.</td>', 'Nice macro, you could have turned your subject 180 so the writing on the chip was facing us.Good photo.', '2007-10-04 10:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
