(4146326, 594497, 18197, '<td valign="top">Well done. The "floating" subject adds to the dynamics and the mystery of this technology. Hope you''ll tell us how you did it.</td>', 'Well done. The "floating" subject adds to the dynamics and the mystery of this technology. Hope you''ll tell us how you did it.', '2007-10-06 01:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
