(4146339, 594755, 18197, '<td valign="top">Composition and colors are good. "Mood" it sets is somehow familiar. Sort of a drunken-camera-phone-in-the-basement-of-the-frat-house feel. We''ve all been there. Thanks for the nostalgia trip!</td>', 'Composition and colors are good. "Mood" it sets is somehow familiar. Sort of a drunken-camera-phone-in-the-basement-of-the-frat-house feel. We''ve all been there. Thanks for the nostalgia trip!', '2007-10-06 01:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4146344, 591977, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like the post processing on this. Gives it a weird sci-fi-end-of-the-world feel.</td>', 'I like the post processing on this. Gives it a weird sci-fi-end-of-the-world feel.', '2007-10-06 01:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4146348, 592028, 18197, '<td valign="top">Colors do a nice job of pushing this squarely into the heart of the challenge theme. Well done. Very dramatic. Very arresting.</td>', 'Colors do a nice job of pushing this squarely into the heart of the challenge theme. Well done. Very dramatic. Very arresting.', '2007-10-06 01:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4146359, 592289, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice idea for the challenge ... a sort of bionic-man photo. The realism of, capture of, and post processing of the hand is good, but the circuits look pasted on. Spoils the illusion. I think if you had put some dark shadowing around the edges of the circuits, it would have contributed to the illusion that the circuits were inside.</td>', 'Nice idea for the challenge ... a sort of bionic-man photo. The realism of, capture of, and post processing of the hand is good, but the circuits look pasted on. Spoils the illusion. I think if you had put some dark shadowing around the edges of the circuits, it would have contributed to the illusion that the circuits were inside.', '2007-10-06 01:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4146364, 594834, 18197, '<td valign="top">I didn''t expect to, but I like the nostalgic feel of this.</td>', 'I didn''t expect to, but I like the nostalgic feel of this.', '2007-10-06 01:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
