(4147478, 594536, 84736, '<td valign="top">I don''t see the technology in this shot, but thats just me. I also just feel that the subject is a little to dark. But the framing of the subject is nice.</td>', 'I don''t see the technology in this shot, but thats just me. I also just feel that the subject is a little to dark. But the framing of the subject is nice.', '2007-10-06 17:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
