(4148023, 591956, 84736, '<td valign="top">i like the thought behind this photo, but i feel as though the disc cracks should have been in better focus in the forground. The focus gets sharpest right at the clear ring of the CD, and i think that with so much of the cracking out of focus, it takes away from the shatter effect of the photo.</td>', 'i like the thought behind this photo, but i feel as though the disc cracks should have been in better focus in the forground. The focus gets sharpest right at the clear ring of the CD, and i think that with so much of the cracking out of focus, it takes away from the shatter effect of the photo.', '2007-10-06 22:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4148032, 594639, 84736, '<td valign="top">Like the angle this wind mill was taken at, not seen like this often. I also like the slightest motion that is visible on the middle blade, reminds you that the blades really do spin. Also the contrast with the sky is great.</td>', 'Like the angle this wind mill was taken at, not seen like this often. I also like the slightest motion that is visible on the middle blade, reminds you that the blades really do spin. Also the contrast with the sky is great.', '2007-10-06 22:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4148041, 594730, 84736, '<td valign="top">The focus is a little soft on this shot. Also, the croping cut offsome of the disk, but there are still hints of what looks to have been a blue backround on the upper right corner and the right side where the disk opens. If thoses were edited out, it would be better isolated and make the shot better. But you can''t go wrong with bright orange...</td>', 'The focus is a little soft on this shot. Also, the croping cut offsome of the disk, but there are still hints of what looks to have been a blue backround on the upper right corner and the right side where the disk opens. If thoses were edited out, it would be better isolated and make the shot better. But you can''t go wrong with bright orange...', '2007-10-06 22:57:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4148050, 593661, 84736, '<td valign="top">this shot is very dark, the focus is very soft, the angle is a little to shallow for reading the keys, and at least on my screen the upper left corner has some major black splotching in it. if that is an edit, cloning might have been a better way to edit out what was there, if anything was... the DOF does look good with the shot.</td>', 'this shot is very dark, the focus is very soft, the angle is a little to shallow for reading the keys, and at least on my screen the upper left corner has some major black splotching in it. if that is an edit, cloning might have been a better way to edit out what was there, if anything was... the DOF does look good with the shot.', '2007-10-06 23:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4148051, 594880, 84736, '<td valign="top">very simple, but lit very well. focus is nice and the angle is great. good shot</td>', 'very simple, but lit very well. focus is nice and the angle is great. good shot', '2007-10-06 23:04:55.000000', NULL, 1),
