(4148061, 594014, 84736, '<td valign="top">very creative shot. i think that the light should have been on the blue side of the eyes, but that is just me.</td>', 'very creative shot. i think that the light should have been on the blue side of the eyes, but that is just me.', '2007-10-06 23:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4148065, 594565, 84736, '<td valign="top">this is a great shot. the blurred motion on the building w/ the boxes in focus rocks. would love to know how you got that shot. Also, b&amp;w is perfect for this, less to distract than if it was in color i feel.</td>', 'this is a great shot. the blurred motion on the building w/ the boxes in focus rocks. would love to know how you got that shot. Also, b&w is perfect for this, less to distract than if it was in color i feel.', '2007-10-06 23:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4148068, 594640, 84736, '<td valign="top">the photo is a little washed out looking. also the subject is dead center. putting it off to the side would make it a little more interesting.</td>', 'the photo is a little washed out looking. also the subject is dead center. putting it off to the side would make it a little more interesting.', '2007-10-06 23:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4148076, 593500, 84736, '<td valign="top">love it. the blur makes the shot so much cooler. the contrast with the yellow and green is nice too. great shot.</td>', 'love it. the blur makes the shot so much cooler. the contrast with the yellow and green is nice too. great shot.', '2007-10-06 23:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
