(4148093, 594279, 84736, '<td valign="top">the caveman part of the photo is nice, but the insert of the screen does not look natural. because of that, the photo loses some quality. if only he looked like one of the geico cavemen though...</td>', 'the caveman part of the photo is nice, but the insert of the screen does not look natural. because of that, the photo loses some quality. if only he looked like one of the geico cavemen though...', '2007-10-06 23:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
