(4149637, 593617, 68648, '<td valign="top">This is very fine.  The lighting is just right for "atmosphere" and to bring out the texture of the old pump.  The composition is not standard, but I think that makes it all the more interesting and dynamic</td>', 'This is very fine.  The lighting is just right for "atmosphere" and to bring out the texture of the old pump.  The composition is not standard, but I think that makes it all the more interesting and dynamic', '2007-10-07 17:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
