(4151439, 591878, 79720, '<td valign="top">Must be whiterook. The posterization doesn''t help this image, IMO. I might suggest to move in to frame the chessclock and a few pieces, rather than capture the whole table and incidental background.</td>', 'Must be whiterook. The posterization doesn''t help this image, IMO. I might suggest to move in to frame the chessclock and a few pieces, rather than capture the whole table and incidental background.', '2007-10-08 10:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
