(4152066, 594769, 39427, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot, but:  Suggestions:  I think the composition would be stronger with the moon in the center, because as it stands its just a tinnny bit off center and it throws me off.  I''d say either off to one side, OR in the center, but not just-off center.  Also, more importantly you need more contrast!  Do some dodging and burning in those clouds to make them pop, and use Curves/Levels to make the image less flat.  This looks like its straight out of the camera 7</td>', 'I really like this shot, but:  Suggestions:  I think the composition would be stronger with the moon in the center, because as it stands its just a tinnny bit off center and it throws me off.  I''d say either off to one side, OR in the center, but not just-off center.  Also, more importantly you need more contrast!  Do some dodging and burning in those clouds to make them pop, and use Curves/Levels to make the image less flat.  This looks like its straight out of the camera 7', '2007-10-08 15:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4152068, 594528, 12733, '<td valign="top">I''d like the picture better without the gimmickry.</td>', 'I''d like the picture better without the gimmickry.', '2007-10-08 15:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
