(4154761, 593115, 16062, '<td valign="top">It bugs me a little that you can see the contact edge of the board that would normally plug into a motherboard.  It sort of identifies the electronics as a regular expansion card that plugs into a PC.  If you couldn''t see the edge, it would be more like the electronics were integrated into the shoe itself.  Still, I like the image.  Highlights are a little hot, but the reflection is cool and the pink adds a little pop.</td>', 'It bugs me a little that you can see the contact edge of the board that would normally plug into a motherboard.  It sort of identifies the electronics as a regular expansion card that plugs into a PC.  If you couldn''t see the edge, it would be more like the electronics were integrated into the shoe itself.  Still, I like the image.  Highlights are a little hot, but the reflection is cool and the pink adds a little pop.', '2007-10-09 15:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4154770, 594619, 16062, '<td valign="top">indeed!</td>', 'indeed!', '2007-10-09 15:52:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4154772, 592194, 61795, '<td valign="top">Love it! Colours just bursting out and dragging you into the picture. Love it!</td>', 'Love it! Colours just bursting out and dragging you into the picture. Love it!', '2007-10-09 15:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
