(4155776, 594806, 67697, '<td valign="top">Earl flew quickly down the stairs<br/>To run and look at the seven pairs<br/>Of shoes he left by the door.<br/> <br/>He hoped to find<br/>Gifts from a spirit so kind<br/>Because he did not want to go to the store.<br/> <br/>See, Earl was a dork<br/>And rammed his fork<br/>Into the heart of the TV remote<br/> <br/>In great despair<br/>He knocked over his chair<br/>And ran to throw on his coat<br/> <br/>He stopped in his tracks<br/>Before putting on his slacks<br/>Because something had caught his attention<br/> <br/>By the door,<br/>He saw on the floor,<br/>The shoes put there by his children<br/> <br/>Tonight was the night<br/>A visitor sneaks in from out of sight<br/>To leave little gifts in all the sneakers<br/> <br/>St. Nicholas time!<br/>Earl knows I cannot rhyme!<br/>So we will end this soon for all the readers <br/> <br/>Much to his delight, <br/>St. Nicholas took care of Earls plight<br/>And filled his shoes with plenty.<br/> <br/>But later to his dismay,<br/>Earl again had a bad day,<br/>Because the battery compartments of all the remotes<br/>Were empty .  :)</td>', 'Earl flew quickly down the stairsTo run and look at the seven pairsOf shoes he left by the door. He hoped to findGifts from a spirit so kindBecause he did not want to go to the store. See, Earl was a dorkAnd rammed his forkInto the heart of the TV remote In great despairHe knocked over his chairAnd ran to throw on his coat He stopped in his tracksBefore putting on his slacksBecause something had caught his attention By the door,He saw on the floor,The shoes put there by his children Tonight was the nightA visitor sneaks in from out of sightTo leave little gifts in all the sneakers St. Nicholas time!Earl knows I cannot rhyme!So we will end this soon for all the readers  Much to his delight, St. Nicholas took care of Earls plightAnd filled his shoes with plenty. But later to his dismay,Earl again had a bad day,Because the battery compartments of all the remotesWere empty .  :)', '2007-10-10 00:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
