(4155980, 593900, 31403, '<td valign="top">when an image of this power places 12 under a wet hard drive, something is wrong.  It reaffirms my decision to largely stay away from this place.<br/> <br/>Powerfully emotive.  Great work - I hope the child isn''t yours.  If it is, I admire you even more for taking time to document this difficult time.  I''ve had small ones in ICU, I learned a lot about myself and life, but would never wish it on anyone.<br/> <br/>You get the DigitalKnight Blue - congratulations!</td>', 'when an image of this power places 12 under a wet hard drive, something is wrong.  It reaffirms my decision to largely stay away from this place. Powerfully emotive.  Great work - I hope the child isn''t yours.  If it is, I admire you even more for taking time to document this difficult time.  I''ve had small ones in ICU, I learned a lot about myself and life, but would never wish it on anyone. You get the DigitalKnight Blue - congratulations!', '2007-10-10 01:18:53.000000', NULL, 0),
