(4156943, 592999, 84668, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bbbix:</b></div><hr/><i> I''m not sure how you did this, but its very well done.  I like it! </i></td></tr></table> <br/>This is a sculpture made of a transparent plastic material. I took the picture at dark, shutter 15s. Then during the 15s I used some LEDs and an incandescent light to lit the composition.</td>', 'Originally posted by bbbix: I''m not sure how you did this, but its very well done.  I like it!  This is a sculpture made of a transparent plastic material. I took the picture at dark, shutter 15s. Then during the 15s I used some LEDs and an incandescent light to lit the composition.', '2007-10-10 09:52:34.000000', NULL, 0),
