(4156951, 592999, 84668, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by _DaveA_:</b></div><hr/><i> Wild! I love it. My only criticism is the blurred swatch of neon-like yellow-orange shape in the upper left corner. That detracts from what one would expect to be the continuation of the mask. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>This is the LED that accidentally passed in front of the sculpture during the 15s exposure. It was late and I decided I''d not take another one. This was the better from about 15 shots that I took.</td>', 'Originally posted by _DaveA_: Wild! I love it. My only criticism is the blurred swatch of neon-like yellow-orange shape in the upper left corner. That detracts from what one would expect to be the continuation of the mask.  This is the LED that accidentally passed in front of the sculpture during the 15s exposure. It was late and I decided I''d not take another one. This was the better from about 15 shots that I took.', '2007-10-10 09:55:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(4156965, 594506, 66348, '<td valign="top">Well done!! Loved your first entry, and on your 2nd a ribbon. So glad you found DPC and that we will be able to see much more of your work. Congrats on a great shot and the Ribb!</td>', 'Well done!! Loved your first entry, and on your 2nd a ribbon. So glad you found DPC and that we will be able to see much more of your work. Congrats on a great shot and the Ribb!', '2007-10-10 10:05:11.000000', NULL, 0),
