(4163885, 594159, 82985, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the info--I am new here, so I didn''t know the rules for advanced editing--no offense intended.  This is great image--I just moved away after 25 yrs in AZ, so I guess I moved away before getting to see the river so muddy-red.  Really something. Nicely done.</td>', 'Thanks for the info--I am new here, so I didn''t know the rules for advanced editing--no offense intended.  This is great image--I just moved away after 25 yrs in AZ, so I guess I moved away before getting to see the river so muddy-red.  Really something. Nicely done.', '2007-10-12 22:05:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(4163895, 593479, 28070, '<td valign="top">Come on people.  Art is metaphors, similies, personification, and analogies.  <br/> <br/>This is really neat.   Being the hard disk has overflowed, using water (known to most people to have the quality of overflowing) to illustrate an electronic digital concept of the addition of a binary number and not enough registers to account for the total value after the calculation.</td>', 'Come on people.  Art is metaphors, similies, personification, and analogies.   This is really neat.   Being the hard disk has overflowed, using water (known to most people to have the quality of overflowing) to illustrate an electronic digital concept of the addition of a binary number and not enough registers to account for the total value after the calculation.', '2007-10-12 22:09:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(4164093, 592028, 69008, '<td valign="top">The electric purple glow is great for this shot, and the way the brightness in the sky lines up with the wires makes it even better.  It fits the challenge theme well. Good finish, Congrats!</td>', 'The electric purple glow is great for this shot, and the way the brightness in the sky lines up with the wires makes it even better.  It fits the challenge theme well. Good finish, Congrats!', '2007-10-13 00:39:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(4165320, 594878, 68035, '<td valign="top">I like the dof you created on this shot although I will confess that sines and cosines are all Greek to me<br/> <br/>Sorry you are feeling challenge burnout, I guess that fighting through it is a positive step to take<br/> <br/>I always maintain that the bottom line is not how a picture scores but how you feel about it and that you enjoyed taking it, the rest is a mere bagatelle</td>', 'I like the dof you created on this shot although I will confess that sines and cosines are all Greek to me Sorry you are feeling challenge burnout, I guess that fighting through it is a positive step to take I always maintain that the bottom line is not how a picture scores but how you feel about it and that you enjoyed taking it, the rest is a mere bagatelle', '2007-10-13 20:46:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(4165432, 594852, 68035, '<td valign="top">Nice shot Lisa and I love the B&amp;W conversion....I think this would have placed even higher in the current POV challenge (but there again how often does it happen that you get a ''perfect'' picture either a week too early or late for a challenge<br/> <br/>BTW...Is it too early to talk about the rugby?????</td>', 'Nice shot Lisa and I love the B&W conversion....I think this would have placed even higher in the current POV challenge (but there again how often does it happen that you get a ''perfect'' picture either a week too early or late for a challenge BTW...Is it too early to talk about the rugby?????', '2007-10-13 21:26:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(4166145, 594878, 70514, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... looks like Blue Valley High School did me WRONG!  I''ve never heard of this little "reminder".  Still love the idea, and you did a wonderful job getting your subjects in perfect focus.</td>', 'Hmmm... looks like Blue Valley High School did me WRONG!  I''ve never heard of this little "reminder".  Still love the idea, and you did a wonderful job getting your subjects in perfect focus.', '2007-10-14 04:12:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(4167497, 591977, 66384, '<td valign="top">For a minute, I thought this was the place Bob took me on the morning we met for breakfast. But then I noticed the road, which wasn''t in Bob''s place. I love what you have done with these colors. The shot is a little frightening, as if the power lines and structures have come to life and are taking over. Actually we really have been taken over by electricity. Excellent.</td>', 'For a minute, I thought this was the place Bob took me on the morning we met for breakfast. But then I noticed the road, which wasn''t in Bob''s place. I love what you have done with these colors. The shot is a little frightening, as if the power lines and structures have come to life and are taking over. Actually we really have been taken over by electricity. Excellent.', '2007-10-14 23:03:12.000000', NULL, 0),
