(4294029, 592194, 31637, '<td valign="top">The colors here are just rich! the exposure is bright enough for this shot and all your roadway lamps are exposed perfectly. The Crop is different and as tight as it can get for this bridge. Worth climbing the safety rail, photographers must sometimes. Kudos for fitting in the moon without sacrificing to crop bridge. I agree moon is weird and blotchy.  Shame they don''t put lights on this bridge''s horizontal suspension cables, the towers are very defined with all it''s little shadows and highlights.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-12-05 21:07:01.</i></td>', 'The colors here are just rich! the exposure is bright enough for this shot and all your roadway lamps are exposed perfectly. The Crop is different and as tight as it can get for this bridge. Worth climbing the safety rail, photographers must sometimes. Kudos for fitting in the moon without sacrificing to crop bridge. I agree moon is weird and blotchy.  Shame they don''t put lights on this bridge''s horizontal suspension cables, the towers are very defined with all it''s little shadows and highlights.', '2007-12-05 21:05:25.000000', '2007-12-05 21:07:01.000000', 0),
(4294166, 594686, 31637, '<td valign="top">I''ll be looking at this one after I finally get my Manhattan Bridge shot sometime soon already!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-12-05 21:41:22.</i></td>', 'I''ll be looking at this one after I finally get my Manhattan Bridge shot sometime soon already!', '2007-12-05 21:41:03.000000', '2007-12-05 21:41:22.000000', 0),
